  "limits": [
    "Exact bounded static bytes and selected registration/constructor instruction decoding only; no native game or shader execution.",
    "Field names are FNV/layout candidates; hashes do not exclude collisions or authenticate native literal names.",
    "Native descriptor tags 5 and 10 align with uint16 and float32 in the pinned BIN reader. Packed flag masks identify constructor bits, without certifying later overrides or runtime orientation semantics.",
    "Full constructor bytes include exception cleanup. The normal return is at 0x1018acbb0; later cleanup is not a successful construction path.",
    "This record neither replaces historical LLVM text nor establishes actual Yi dispatch, shader behavior or native visual parity.",
    "The prior accepted application certificate remains 3070 passing tests out of 3073, with the same three baseline failures; no game source or asset changed.",
    "Capstone 5.0.3 was used only for fresh local exploration; the retained producer requires no disassembler and does not replace pinned historical LLVM artifacts."
  ],
